      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EL REY (1) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 2.5 lengths (30.83) at this track in a Grade 5 over 530m. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Top prospect. WONDER I DO (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (31.29) last time in a OPEN at Gawler. Has a good record at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Great chance to atone. EXTREME GRUNT (4) is an honest type who is new to this track. Had the inside and was too good last time scoring by 2 lengths at Q Parklands over 520m (29.92). Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can measure up again. PAW LEON (8) jumped best and was never headed last time. Sure to figure prominently.",
